     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap vaccine-covid19-euur-to-icd11</b></p><a name=\"vaccine-covid19-euur-to-icd11\"> </a><a name=\"hcvaccine-covid19-euur-to-icd11\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-WHODDCCeuur.html\">EUUR codes used in this IG</a> to <code>http://id.who.int/icd11/mms</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>EU/1/20/1528 (Comirnaty)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM8NQ0 (Comirnaty)</td></tr><tr><td>EU/1/20/1507 (Spikevax)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM3DT5 (COVID-19 Vaccine Moderna)</td></tr><tr><td>EU/1/21/1529 (Vaxzevria)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM4YL8 (COVID-19 Vaccine AstraZeneca)</td></tr><tr><td>EU/1/20/1525 (Jcovden)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM6QV1 (COVID-19 Vaccine Janssen)</td></tr><tr><td>CVnCoV</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>XM0GQ8 (COVID-19 vaccine, RNA based)</td></tr><tr><td>NVX-CoV2373</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM9T65 (Novavax COVID-19 vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>Sputnik-V</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM5ZJ4 (Gam-Covid-Vac)</td></tr><tr><td>Convidecia</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM1AG7 (Convidecia)</td></tr><tr><td>EpiVacCorona</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM6SZ8 (EpiVacCorona)</td></tr><tr><td>BBIBP-CorV</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM8866 (BBIBP-CorV)</td></tr><tr><td>Inactivated-SARS-CoV-2-Vero-Cell (Inactivated SARS-CoV-2 (Vero Cell))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>XM1NL1 (COVID-19 vaccine, inactivated virus)</td></tr><tr><td>CoronaVac</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM7HT3 (CoronaVac®)</td></tr><tr><td>Covaxin</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM1G90 (Covaxin)</td></tr><tr><td>Covishield</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM97T2 (Covishield®)</td></tr><tr><td>Covid-19-recombinant (Covid-19 (recombinant))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">